    "description": "Set along a white-sand beach on the Caribbean Sea, this upscale all-inclusive, adults-only hotel is 82 km from the ancient Mayan archaeological site at Tulum.\nWarmly decorated rooms come with complimentary minibars and Wi-Fi, as well as flat-screen TVs, tea and coffeemakers, and whirlpool tubs. All rooms provide sitting areas and furnished balconies. Suites add separate living rooms, while villas have private pools.\nAmenities include multiple stylish restaurants and bars offering open-air dining, plus outdoor pools with terraces and sunloungers."
